Consider two words $u=u_1\dots u_\ell$ and $v=v_1\dots v_m$ with symbols from $\Sigma$ and $\ell,m\ge 2$.
		\begin{itemize}
			\item Fix $0\le s\le \ell-1$. We say that $s\in (u,v)$, if $u_{s+1}\dots u_\ell=v_1\dots v_{\ell-s}$.
			\item Set
			\[
			c_{s,u,v} := \begin{cases}
