			\item If $\ell-1\in (u,v)$, then $u_\ell=v_1$. We denote $\delta_v:=\delta_{\ell-1,u,v}=\mu(C_v)/p_{v_1}$.  
			\item For a prime word $u$, $\tau_u(z)=1$.
			                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
			                                                                        
			                                                                                                             
